                "summary": "- The Pomeranian Philharmonic is located in Bydgoszcz.\n- The architectural concept for the Philharmonic's expansion was developed by the Kraków-based studio Kozień Architekci.\n- The expansion plans include a new wing with a small concert hall, stage, and other facilities.\n- The project is considered the most important cultural investment in the Kujawsko-Pomorskie region.\n- The expansion was based on a functional program developed by the Poznań-based firm Sound & Space.\n- The project includes an underground parking system and a new restaurant and café.",
